          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वैमानिक (vaimānik) is Sanskrit vaimānika, \"one who rides a celestial car\", a tatsama built on vimāna, \"car of the gods\" (CDIAL 11823), now \"aeroplane\"."
